<title>SWEDEN: Skanska sells 1.8 mln shrs in Custos.</title>
<headline>Skanska sells 1.8 mln shrs in Custos.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction company Skanska AB said on Tuesday it sold 1.81 million A-series shares in Swedish investment company AB Custos.</p>
<p>The shares represented its entire remaining stake in Custos, Skanska said in a statement.</p>
<p>At 0940, Custos traded at 128 crowns per share, up two on the day.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1003</p>
